{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118524","id":3523910357,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SCprV","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118524","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118524.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118524.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118524","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118524/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118524/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118524/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1ed5404d245b9c35c002eb174e2a4706dd4f1d22","number":118524,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make ParticleProcessMaterial Amount Ratio deterministic","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Previously, a random check was used to discard particles according to the value of Amount Ratio in GPUParticles. This made its behavior less predictable.\r\n\r\nThe new behavior matches a GPUParticles node with a lowered Amount property. For example, a GPUParticles node with Amount = 8 and Amount Ratio = 0.25 will look the same as a GPUParticles node with Amount = 2 and Amount Ratio = 1.0.\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104276.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_particle_amount_ratio_deterministic.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26681139/test_particle_amount_ratio_deterministic.zip)\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n*This video was recorded on `master` to show a comparison with the current behavior. The behavior of this PR matches the particles on the right. If you run the testing project with this PR, all columns will look identical.*\r\n\r\n[particle_amount_ratio_deterministic.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1de6d89-647d-4ee1-aac2-01f1398d0c13)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issue